WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:48.969
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:49.239 --> 01:50.599
Shift's over. Why haven't you gone home?

3
01:56.480 --> 01:57.079
What's the matter?

4
01:58.040 --> 01:58.879
Can't bring yourself to write it?

5
01:59.840 --> 02:01.599
Want to take a look at the resignation letter

6
02:01.599 --> 02:02.640
I wrote back in the day?

7
02:10.159 --> 02:10.680
Come walk with me.

8
02:19.639 --> 02:21.680
The police force will never fight crime any less

9
02:22.599 --> 02:24.520
just because you're gone.

10
02:26.000 --> 02:27.879
New officers will always step up

11
02:28.719 --> 02:31.680
to defend our honor and keep this city safe.

12
02:40.240 --> 02:40.680
Xiao,

13
02:41.000 --> 02:43.800
you're thinking of resigning because of Tian Xin, right?

14
02:48.439 --> 02:49.080
You know about that?

15
02:52.199 --> 02:53.159
I met with Tian Xin.

16
02:54.599 --> 02:57.439
Her father's sacrifice took a heavy toll on her.

17
02:58.280 --> 03:00.199
She doesn't want you to stay a cop,

18
03:01.360 --> 03:02.360
which is completely understandable.

19
03:04.319 --> 03:06.360
Back then, your aunt worried about my safety too.

20
03:06.879 --> 03:08.360
We fought over it countless times.

21
03:09.080 --> 03:10.719
She wanted me to find a stable job.

22
03:13.039 --> 03:16.120
I faced the exact same dilemma back then.

23
03:18.319 --> 03:19.759
But in the end, I didn't give it up.

24
03:19.919 --> 03:20.680
Maybe...

25
03:21.360 --> 03:23.560
deep down, I just refuse to give in.

26
03:23.800 --> 03:26.159
I can't stand letting criminals walk free.

27
03:26.719 --> 03:27.400
I know you.

28
03:28.039 --> 03:29.400
You're just like me in that regard.

29
03:30.840 --> 03:32.240
With your abilities, I know

30
03:32.439 --> 03:33.280
in any other field,

31
03:33.280 --> 03:34.800
you'd thrive and do exceptionally well.

32
03:35.719 --> 03:37.199
But every day after that,

33
03:37.840 --> 03:40.360
you might have to live with

34
03:40.360 --> 03:42.159
the regret in your heart.

35
03:46.080 --> 03:46.680
Of course,

36
03:47.240 --> 03:49.400
how you choose is your right.

37
03:50.240 --> 03:51.039
It's your freedom.

38
03:52.560 --> 03:54.360
I'm sure our brothers on the force

39
03:54.840 --> 03:56.120
will understand your decision, too.

40
03:59.800 --> 04:01.840
I don't know if it's worth it for you.

41
04:02.560 --> 04:03.479
All I know is,

42
04:04.599 --> 04:05.840
you have to be true to yourself,

43
04:07.560 --> 04:09.639
true to what's really in your heart.

44
04:37.759 --> 04:38.519
Are you off work yet?

45
04:39.839 --> 04:41.160
Yeah, I just got off.

46
04:42.480 --> 04:43.399
Are you free?

47
04:44.879 --> 04:45.800
Let's meet up.

48
04:48.120 --> 04:49.120
Okay, I'll head over.

49
04:50.800 --> 04:51.759
I'll wait for you at home.

50
04:57.959 --> 04:58.720
Honestly, these past few days,

51
04:58.720 --> 05:00.120
I've been wanting to call her.

52
05:01.319 --> 05:02.279
But I know

53
05:03.759 --> 05:05.279
I can't be who she wants me to be.

54
05:12.600 --> 05:13.360
Go see her.

55
05:15.000 --> 05:16.759
Whether you decide to be with her

56
05:17.240 --> 05:18.360
or stay on the force,

57
05:19.240 --> 05:21.439
I trust your decision will be right.

58
05:21.800 --> 05:23.240
Just make sure, before you decide,

59
05:24.879 --> 05:26.959
you know exactly what you're doing.

60
05:28.079 --> 05:29.839
Be true to your heart,

61
05:30.600 --> 05:32.000
and leave no regrets.

62
05:36.399 --> 05:36.800
Go on.

63
06:04.079 --> 06:05.399
Director Huang was here this morning.

64
06:09.560 --> 06:10.920
He often comes to visit your father.

65
06:47.360 --> 06:48.319
The truth is, I've never

66
06:50.759 --> 06:53.160
been able to accept that my father is gone.

67
06:55.920 --> 06:57.199
I rarely visit him.

68
07:05.600 --> 07:06.560
Are you still

69
07:08.560 --> 07:10.480
unable to forgive him?

70
07:16.319 --> 07:17.199
These past two days,

71
07:19.120 --> 07:20.879
I feel like I've gotten to know my father again.

72
07:28.079 --> 07:29.319
Back then, all I knew was

73
07:30.439 --> 07:31.800
that he wouldn't listen to Mom

74
07:33.240 --> 07:35.240
and stubbornly went his own way,

75
07:38.199 --> 07:39.120
which ultimately led to

76
07:39.680 --> 07:41.439
us losing our complete family.

77
07:44.319 --> 07:45.800
It wasn't until yesterday that I realized

78
07:47.439 --> 07:48.639
everything he did

79
07:50.079 --> 07:51.360
wasn't just for others,

80
07:52.800 --> 07:54.120
but for Mom and me, too.

81
08:02.000 --> 08:03.040
Everyone here

82
08:05.839 --> 08:06.560
had a family,

83
08:08.439 --> 08:09.439
and loved ones.

84
08:11.839 --> 08:12.879
Their sacrifice

85
08:14.399 --> 08:15.959
was to protect even more families.

86
08:39.799 --> 08:40.919
I'm really conflicted right now.

87
08:43.879 --> 08:46.200
I've accepted that you're a cop,

88
08:49.480 --> 08:51.120
but deep down, I have a thousand,

89
08:51.120 --> 08:52.919
ten thousand worries and fears.

90
08:54.039 --> 08:56.080
I'm scared that if I'm with you,

91
08:56.320 --> 08:57.399
suddenly one day...

92
09:06.960 --> 09:07.519
I...

93
09:13.720 --> 09:15.200
If that day really comes,

94
09:18.000 --> 09:19.799
I hope you can give yourself

95
09:21.080 --> 09:22.840
a chance to start over.

96
09:36.200 --> 09:36.840
Li Xiao,

97
09:38.840 --> 09:40.559
can we start over?

98
09:42.440 --> 09:43.039
This time,

99
09:44.840 --> 09:45.879
you're a cop,

100
09:48.080 --> 09:49.600
and I'm a cafe owner.

101
09:50.600 --> 09:51.759
I know who you are,

102
09:55.279 --> 09:57.279
but I still want to be with you.

103
11:12.720 --> 11:14.639
Jiechan State has a complex political background,

104
11:15.240 --> 11:17.320
coupled with its past lawless status,

105
11:17.720 --> 11:19.600
attracting illegal armed groups from abroad

106
11:19.799 --> 11:21.320
to set up their own plantations

107
11:21.320 --> 11:22.080
and processing factories here.

108
11:22.360 --> 11:23.879
During the height of the drug trade,

109
11:24.960 --> 11:27.080
annual drug production in Jiechan State

110
11:27.600 --> 11:28.519
reached as high as 6,000 tons.

111
11:37.240 --> 11:38.519
Look at the area ahead.

112
11:40.080 --> 11:42.080
This used to be Jesdaporn's plantation.

113
11:42.440 --> 11:43.360
At the end of the last century,

114
11:43.480 --> 11:45.200
Jesdaporn was wiped out by The Four Major Families.

115
11:46.519 --> 11:48.759
In a joint multinational operation, Interpol

116
11:49.639 --> 11:52.519
completely wiped out the armed forces here.

117
12:02.480 --> 12:05.159
Why are so many in this village disabled?

118
12:20.519 --> 12:21.879
These villagers were once

119
12:21.879 --> 12:23.639
the ones who grew drugs for Jesdaporn.

120
12:24.679 --> 12:25.759
Many people assume

121
12:26.000 --> 12:28.519
that everyone in Jiechan State is ruthless.

122
12:29.240 --> 12:30.360
That's actually not the case.

123
12:30.759 --> 12:31.919
These villagers are truly pitiful.

124
12:33.320 --> 12:34.360
Deep down, they never wanted

125
12:34.399 --> 12:35.919
to grow drugs for Jesdaporn.

126
12:37.840 --> 12:38.960
Once Jesdaporn found out,

127
12:38.960 --> 12:40.799
he sent men to sever their hands and feet,

128
12:41.000 --> 12:41.960
and threatened their families.

129
12:50.799 --> 12:52.440
And after Jesdaporn was taken down?

130
12:53.039 --> 12:55.600
The Four Major Families and new cartels,

131
12:55.759 --> 12:58.279
where international forces can't reach,

132
12:58.639 --> 12:59.960
fought over territory once again

133
13:00.559 --> 13:01.399
and built new plantations.

134
13:01.559 --> 13:02.960
That's why global anti-drug agencies

135
13:03.399 --> 13:04.399
have taken on a new mission.

136
13:06.519 --> 13:07.840
When will drugs

137
13:08.799 --> 13:10.919
finally vanish from this world for good?

138
13:20.240 --> 13:21.279
In this world,

139
13:22.559 --> 13:24.399
two illegal trades yield the most profit.

140
13:25.000 --> 13:26.000
The first is arms trafficking,

141
13:26.919 --> 13:27.960
and the second is drugs.

142
13:28.519 --> 13:30.720
To make more money and make it faster,

143
13:32.120 --> 13:33.840
some people are always willing to risk it.

144
13:37.639 --> 13:38.320
Yeah.

145
13:39.320 --> 13:40.600
After fighting drugs for so many years,

146
13:41.200 --> 13:42.399
I've sometimes wondered

147
13:44.080 --> 13:45.200
if a day will ever come

148
13:45.759 --> 13:47.559
when justice truly triumphs over evil.

149
13:50.960 --> 13:53.279
To many people, that thought seems naive.

150
13:54.960 --> 13:55.879
Even so,

151
13:56.200 --> 13:58.000
I still hope that in my lifetime,

152
13:58.440 --> 14:00.720
I'll see drugs disappear from this world.

153
14:34.879 --> 14:35.639
Mr. Donald,

154
14:36.240 --> 14:37.399
allow me to introduce them.

155
14:37.399 --> 14:38.840
This is Zhuang Yan, and this is Ge Dan.

156
14:38.960 --> 14:40.679
And this is Country M Police's

157
14:40.679 --> 14:42.120
narcotics expert, Mr. Donald.

158
14:42.120 --> 14:42.840
Pleased to meet you.

159
14:42.840 --> 14:43.879
Nice to meet you.

160
14:43.960 --> 14:44.639
Nice to meet you.

161
14:45.000 --> 14:48.000
Country M police will fully assist you.

162
14:48.399 --> 14:49.600
Please have a seat.

163
15:04.399 --> 15:05.919
As for your operation,

164
15:06.320 --> 15:08.200
Mr. Donald will be in full charge.

165
15:09.879 --> 15:11.080
Let me give you a brief overview.

166
15:12.799 --> 15:14.240
Ever since ten years ago,

167
15:14.960 --> 15:16.879
when a multinational op in Jiechan State

168
15:17.200 --> 15:19.399
wiped out several major drug syndicates,

169
15:20.080 --> 15:21.759
new international drug cartels

170
15:21.840 --> 15:23.600
have begun spreading across the region.

171
15:23.679 --> 15:25.600
The drug trade in Jiechan State

172
15:25.600 --> 15:26.799
is rearing its head again.

173
15:27.440 --> 15:29.360
Right now, the situation we face

174
15:29.440 --> 15:30.879
is extremely grim.

175
15:32.519 --> 15:34.440
Country M Police Headquarters

176
15:34.559 --> 15:36.279
has reached a police cooperation agreement

177
15:36.279 --> 15:43.000
with your country's police.

178
15:43.639 --> 15:44.879
We invited the two of you here

179
15:44.879 --> 15:46.960
primarily in hopes that you

180
15:47.519 --> 15:49.440
can infiltrate the criminal organization,

181
15:49.679 --> 15:52.080
to secure valuable leads for the drug bust

182
15:52.080 --> 15:53.840
conducted by China and Country M,

183
15:53.840 --> 15:55.159
and gathering evidence of their crimes.

184
15:56.200 --> 15:57.000
Mr. Mai mentioned

185
15:57.000 --> 15:58.440
that Interpol would arrange

186
15:58.440 --> 16:00.320
for us to enter Hirano Prison.

187
16:00.320 --> 16:02.360
Does that mean during this operation,

188
16:03.519 --> 16:05.440
we might break the laws of Country M?

189
16:07.080 --> 16:10.000
Your op will be registered as top secret

190
16:10.000 --> 16:11.919
with Interpol,

191
16:11.919 --> 16:14.039
your country's police,

192
16:14.039 --> 16:17.120
and Country M Police Headquarters.

193
16:17.360 --> 16:18.919
However, I wonder, Mr. Zhuang Yan,

194
16:18.919 --> 16:20.480
how you view the coordination between

195
16:20.480 --> 16:21.559
Country M police and Interpol.

196
16:21.559 --> 16:22.519
In other words,

197
16:22.919 --> 16:23.960
for this operation,

198
16:23.960 --> 16:25.519
all three parties granted maximum freedom,

199
16:25.600 --> 16:27.080
as long as we report and communicate.

200
16:27.519 --> 16:28.159
Is that correct?

201
16:30.200 --> 16:32.039
As for the specific mission deployment,

202
16:32.279 --> 16:34.279
we can discuss that privately.

203
16:35.200 --> 16:36.679
First, let me brief you both on

204
16:36.679 --> 16:40.840
Jiechan State and Country M's syndicates,

205
16:40.840 --> 16:43.120
and the grim situation we currently face.

206
16:43.320 --> 16:44.519
Next, as you can see,

207
16:44.799 --> 16:47.799
the primary targets of your investigation

208
16:47.799 --> 16:51.720
are the Xiang brothers

209
16:53.279 --> 16:57.120
and Jesdaporn's son, Theerade.

210
17:24.640 --> 17:25.200
Where did you go?

211
17:26.680 --> 17:28.000
I bought some local snacks.

212
17:35.519 --> 17:37.000
Going out alone this late as a girl,

213
17:37.519 --> 17:38.799
you didn't even show any concern for me.

214
17:42.359 --> 17:43.000
What are you doing?

215
17:45.599 --> 17:47.799
Aren't I going to prison in a few days?

216
17:48.759 --> 17:50.039
I feel like I'm missing something on me.

217
17:50.720 --> 17:51.440
Drawing a tattoo.

218
17:52.720 --> 17:53.960
You sure have plenty of ideas.

219
17:55.319 --> 17:55.960
With a tattoo,

220
17:55.960 --> 17:58.279
it'll help me pull off the mission better.

221
17:58.640 --> 17:59.279
Let me draw it for you.

222
18:01.279 --> 18:02.000
Can you do it?

223
18:02.599 --> 18:03.119
Sure I can.

224
18:05.319 --> 18:07.039
What should I draw on you?

225
18:09.599 --> 18:10.359
Mickey Mouse.

226
18:10.359 --> 18:10.880
No way.

227
18:11.960 --> 18:12.680
Then...

228
18:14.039 --> 18:14.799
Born to die.

229
18:20.319 --> 18:21.200
Live towards death.

230
18:21.519 --> 18:23.519
Right, live towards death.

231
18:28.839 --> 18:29.359
What's wrong?

232
18:31.680 --> 18:32.720
Back in Nanhai City,

233
18:34.119 --> 18:35.079
whenever we were on a mission,

234
18:35.720 --> 18:37.319
no matter what danger we faced,

235
18:37.559 --> 18:39.519
our colleagues would back us up instantly.

236
18:41.160 --> 18:42.279
But this time is different.

237
18:43.119 --> 18:43.720
Scared?

238
18:44.160 --> 18:45.160
Then why did you come along?

239
18:48.079 --> 18:50.039
This is a cross-border operation.

240
18:50.880 --> 18:52.359
It'll definitely be more dangerous.

241
18:52.799 --> 18:53.960
I'm not scared for myself.

242
18:55.759 --> 18:56.640
I'm worried about you.

243
19:00.599 --> 19:01.400
Remember what I said.

244
19:02.640 --> 19:04.079
I will definitely return safe and sound.

245
19:06.000 --> 19:06.720
Trust me.

246
19:12.640 --> 19:13.319
Besides,

247
19:14.079 --> 19:15.799
we have a strong motherland backing us up,

248
19:16.039 --> 19:16.519
don't we?

249
19:21.000 --> 19:21.680
You said it.

250
19:23.839 --> 19:24.359
Don't lie to me.

251
19:25.240 --> 19:25.880
I said it.

252
19:27.000 --> 19:27.839
I'm not lying.

253
19:29.839 --> 19:30.880
And in this world,

254
19:31.519 --> 19:32.920
evil will never triumph over good.

255
19:34.920 --> 19:37.000
Still, since coming out here,

256
19:38.480 --> 19:39.680
you've really changed quite a bit.

257
19:44.839 --> 19:46.160
Not as rigid as you used to be.

258
19:46.680 --> 19:48.000
My identity is different now, isn't it?

259
19:53.559 --> 19:54.160
Don't be sad.

260
19:54.759 --> 19:55.240
Go on, draw it.

261
20:49.519 --> 20:51.519
Before going to the Financial Tower,

262
20:51.599 --> 20:52.559
Liang Wenbiao took two calls.

263
20:53.079 --> 20:54.240
I suspect that in this deal,

264
20:54.240 --> 20:55.200
besides Li Qiang,

265
20:55.599 --> 20:57.240
someone else is involved.

266
20:59.559 --> 21:00.680
Do you have any suspects?

267
21:02.480 --> 21:04.799
Before Liang Wenbiao met Li Qiang,

268
21:04.799 --> 21:06.400
someone was already supplying him.

269
21:07.000 --> 21:08.720
Ever since I met Four-Legged Snake,

270
21:09.079 --> 21:10.000
I've been suspecting...

271
21:10.240 --> 21:12.240
that Liang Wenbiao's supplier

272
21:12.240 --> 21:13.200
might very well be Four-Legged Snake.

273
21:14.160 --> 21:16.240
He might be more than just a supplier.

274
21:19.440 --> 21:21.759
Is it possible to use Liang Wenbiao

275
21:22.119 --> 21:23.839
to dig up more on Four-Legged Snake?

276
21:25.000 --> 21:26.319
Liang Wenbiao is extremely cautious.

277
21:26.839 --> 21:28.640
Every time he meets Four-Legged Snake,

278
21:28.640 --> 21:30.119
he never lets anyone overhear

279
21:30.119 --> 21:30.920
their conversation.

280
21:31.599 --> 21:34.400
If we want more intel on Four-Legged Snake,

281
21:35.359 --> 21:36.799
we'll have to wait for another opening.

282
21:42.240 --> 21:44.319
Two of our officers went to Country M

283
21:45.160 --> 21:47.359
targeting Ma Jingrong and his crew.

284
21:47.720 --> 21:49.559
If Li Qiang flees to Country M,

285
21:49.920 --> 21:51.839
their covers could easily be blown.

286
21:52.160 --> 21:53.640
So our top priority right now

287
21:54.319 --> 21:55.960
is to stay on Liang Wenbiao's trail

288
21:56.440 --> 21:58.079
and capture Li Qiang as soon as possible.

289
21:58.680 --> 21:59.960
Now that this deal fell through,

290
22:00.480 --> 22:02.519
Liang Wenbiao will be even more guarded.

291
22:03.400 --> 22:05.039
He's already begun to suspect

292
22:05.279 --> 22:07.039
there's an undercover cop around him.

293
22:08.640 --> 22:09.400
Does he suspect you?

294
22:10.960 --> 22:11.799
Not for now.

295
22:15.720 --> 22:17.400
Don't make any reckless moves for now.

296
22:17.559 --> 22:18.440
All we have to do is wait

297
22:18.440 --> 22:19.680
for Liang Wenbiao's next deal.

298
22:20.519 --> 22:21.160
Also,

299
22:21.720 --> 22:23.319
during Liang Wenbiao's next deal,

300
22:23.880 --> 22:25.559
he'll definitely take your phones again.

301
22:26.319 --> 22:27.079
Find an opportunity

302
22:27.920 --> 22:30.640
to plant this tracker on his car.

303
22:33.319 --> 22:35.599
There's a new number on this phone.

304
22:36.480 --> 22:37.680
Call your family

305
22:37.759 --> 22:38.559
and let them know you're safe.

306
22:39.000 --> 22:40.599
Remember to destroy the number afterward.

307
22:47.000 --> 22:49.079
I know you're still worried about her,

308
22:49.880 --> 22:51.079
so I went to check on her.

309
22:51.759 --> 22:53.119
She's doing well right now.

310
22:53.960 --> 22:54.839
Don't worry too much.

311
22:57.359 --> 22:57.880
Thank you.

312
23:10.640 --> 23:11.400
Daddy.

313
23:11.400 --> 23:12.559
Daddy, it's Xiaoshu.

314
23:12.720 --> 23:13.480
What's wrong?

315
23:13.480 --> 23:14.720
When are you coming home?

316
23:15.599 --> 23:16.240
Daddy?

317
23:17.279 --> 23:18.160
Be good, Xiaoshu.

318
23:19.839 --> 23:21.279
Let Mommy talk to Daddy.

319
23:42.359 --> 23:42.960
I'm fine.

320
23:43.880 --> 23:44.480
Nothing's wrong.

321
23:46.839 --> 23:49.160
Are you all doing okay now?

322
23:49.960 --> 23:51.039
Same as always.

323
24:02.599 --> 24:03.119
I know.

324
24:04.960 --> 24:06.279
It's too late to say anything now.

325
24:06.880 --> 24:07.880
I'm the one who hurt you both.

326
24:16.559 --> 24:17.119
Please.

327
24:18.839 --> 24:21.160
Please make sure to

328
24:21.519 --> 24:23.160
raise our daughter well.

329
24:23.920 --> 24:24.720
You already said that

330
24:25.279 --> 24:27.440
back when we got divorced.

331
24:34.400 --> 24:35.000
I know.

332
24:36.640 --> 24:37.720
I ruined your lives.

333
24:41.000 --> 24:42.079
It's all my fault.

334
24:50.200 --> 24:50.720
Why?

335
24:51.680 --> 24:53.839
Why do people only cherish what they have

336
24:55.279 --> 24:56.599
after it's gone?

337
25:10.680 --> 25:11.839
Your mom asked about you.

338
25:13.640 --> 25:15.279
I didn't even know what to tell her.

339
26:16.920 --> 26:19.359
Don't tell her about my situation yet.

340
26:21.119 --> 26:23.119
But she'll find out eventually.

341
26:38.519 --> 26:40.079
I want to say a few words to Xiaoshu.

342
26:41.359 --> 26:43.119
Come here, Daddy wants to talk to you.

343
26:45.480 --> 26:46.079
Daddy.

344
26:48.920 --> 26:49.400
Xiaoshu.

345
26:51.039 --> 26:52.519
What Daddy told you last time,

346
26:53.640 --> 26:54.640
do you still remember?

347
26:55.319 --> 26:56.680
You must always listen to Mommy

348
26:57.200 --> 26:58.359
and not make her worry.

349
26:58.960 --> 26:59.440
Remember that, okay?

350
27:00.000 --> 27:00.640
I will.

351
27:06.079 --> 27:06.680
Daddy,

352
27:07.359 --> 27:09.200
when are you coming home?

353
27:27.119 --> 27:28.119
Xiaoshu, listen to me.

354
27:30.759 --> 27:31.920
Dad did something wrong.

355
27:32.680 --> 27:33.240
From now on,

356
27:34.559 --> 27:36.160
I can never come home again.

357
27:41.359 --> 27:44.079
I know Xiaoshu is now

358
27:44.440 --> 27:46.240
a sensible big girl.

359
27:47.319 --> 27:48.119
Promise Dad,

360
27:49.319 --> 27:50.279
from now on, in my place,

361
27:50.720 --> 27:51.960
you'll take good care of Mom,

362
27:52.680 --> 27:53.799
and take good care of yourself.

363
27:54.319 --> 27:55.440
Only then can Dad rest easy.

364
27:56.640 --> 27:57.240
Promise Dad.

365
27:59.920 --> 28:00.519
Okay.

366
28:10.720 --> 28:11.440
Daddy!

367
28:11.440 --> 28:12.960
Daddy, don't go!

368
28:12.960 --> 28:13.960
I want Daddy!

369
28:13.960 --> 28:16.240
I want Daddy!

370
28:16.240 --> 28:18.240
I want Daddy!

371
28:18.440 --> 28:21.559
Tell Daddy to come back!

372
28:22.279 --> 28:24.640
Tell Daddy to come back, Mommy!

373
28:24.640 --> 28:26.599
I want Daddy!

374
28:27.480 --> 28:29.640
I want Daddy!

375
28:38.960 --> 28:40.079
Thank you

376
28:40.839 --> 28:42.799
for letting me see my family.

377
28:47.759 --> 28:48.559
What we promised you,

378
28:48.559 --> 28:50.039
we'll definitely do our best to fulfill.

379
28:50.039 --> 28:51.599
However, your previous statements

380
28:52.200 --> 28:53.880
had a lot of contradictions.

381
28:57.240 --> 28:58.920
You should be ready now

382
28:59.160 --> 29:00.160
to come clean, right?

383
29:07.839 --> 29:08.599
I'm ready.

384
29:09.839 --> 29:11.640
Everything that I know,

385
29:12.079 --> 29:13.759
I will tell you the honest truth.

386
29:13.759 --> 29:14.839
Ask me anything.

387
29:20.000 --> 29:21.559
How do you know Cheng Weimin?

388
29:23.000 --> 29:25.000
I don't know Cheng Weimin at all.

389
29:28.200 --> 29:30.400
Someone else arranged your deals?

390
29:31.759 --> 29:32.640
It was actually simple.

391
29:33.960 --> 29:35.400
Cheng Weimin used the logistics company

392
29:35.759 --> 29:37.440
to ship drugs to Gao Min's address.

393
29:38.119 --> 29:39.319
Once I received the shipment,

394
29:39.519 --> 29:40.559
I'd hand it over to my buyer.

395
29:40.759 --> 29:41.880
Once the buyer got the goods,

396
29:42.039 --> 29:43.640
they wired the money directly

397
29:43.640 --> 29:45.160
into my Alipay account.

398
29:45.319 --> 29:47.119
Then I'd withdraw the cash for my boss.

399
29:48.519 --> 29:51.240
By "boss," you mean Four-Legged Snake,

400
29:51.240 --> 29:51.720
right?

401
29:53.359 --> 29:55.359
I have no idea who Four-Legged Snake is.

402
29:56.279 --> 29:57.880
The man who arranged all this for me

403
29:58.680 --> 29:59.640
was named Chen Hai.

404
30:04.440 --> 30:07.240
You mean Chen Hai from Longze Group?

405
30:08.039 --> 30:08.519
Yes.

406
30:09.839 --> 30:11.400
You were right about one thing:

407
30:11.400 --> 30:12.960
inside Zhongtian Logistics,

408
30:13.200 --> 30:15.119
someone was indeed helping us traffic drugs.

409
30:16.519 --> 30:17.240
Who was it?

410
30:18.519 --> 30:20.400
I don't really know exactly who it was.

411
30:22.480 --> 30:24.440
Back when Chen Hai approached me

412
30:24.759 --> 30:26.160
to do this job for him,

413
30:26.839 --> 30:27.880
he told me

414
30:28.640 --> 30:30.400
that over at Zhongtian Logistics,

415
30:31.319 --> 30:33.000
he spent a fortune bribing people.

416
30:33.839 --> 30:34.960
It was completely safe and foolproof.

417
30:35.680 --> 30:37.079
That's why through Zhongtian Logistics,

418
30:37.079 --> 30:38.400
the drugs shipped to Nanhai

419
30:39.480 --> 30:40.799
were never once inspected.

420
30:42.359 --> 30:44.200
You claim Chen Hai and the logistics company

421
30:44.200 --> 30:45.119
had an insider deal,

422
30:45.799 --> 30:47.920
yet the one who signed the contract

423
30:48.160 --> 30:48.920
was you.

424
30:50.519 --> 30:52.160
That was just a formality.

425
30:53.799 --> 30:55.000
To cover their tracks,

426
30:55.920 --> 30:57.400
they naturally handled the paperwork

427
30:57.400 --> 30:58.079
properly.

428
30:59.000 --> 31:00.119
The person who signed with me

429
31:00.480 --> 31:01.519
was named Zhou Fuhai.

430
31:02.440 --> 31:03.599
Although I can't be sure,

431
31:04.000 --> 31:05.119
I can tell

432
31:06.000 --> 31:07.559
that inside Zhongtian Logistics,

433
31:07.880 --> 31:09.079
the one colluding with Chen Hai

434
31:09.880 --> 31:10.720
is most likely him.

435
31:18.839 --> 31:19.880
This list of buyers...

436
31:21.240 --> 31:22.319
...is the one you gave us earlier.

437
31:22.319 --> 31:23.240
Take another look.

438
31:23.880 --> 31:24.799
Did you leave anyone out?

439
31:26.720 --> 31:29.039
These are just the downlines I developed.

440
31:29.160 --> 31:30.519
Every time I received a shipment,

441
31:30.880 --> 31:33.039
I'd hand part of it to Chen Hai's contact.

442
31:33.680 --> 31:34.680
They were usually large orders.

443
31:35.319 --> 31:37.200
Chen Hai is extremely cautious.

444
31:38.160 --> 31:40.359
He designs the deal to be highly complex.

445
31:41.039 --> 31:42.400
In this transaction chain,

446
31:42.400 --> 31:43.240
everyone

447
31:44.000 --> 31:45.519
knows exactly what they're supposed to do.

448
31:45.759 --> 31:46.599
Once something goes wrong,

449
31:47.240 --> 31:49.039
all he needs to do is cut off

450
31:49.039 --> 31:50.119
a single link in the chain.

451
31:51.279 --> 31:52.119
That way, you police officers

452
31:52.799 --> 31:54.279
can almost never trace it back to him.

453
31:55.920 --> 31:57.039
So you're saying

454
31:57.680 --> 31:59.160
the kidnapping of your ex-wife

455
31:59.599 --> 32:00.799
was also arranged by Chen Hai?

456
32:03.759 --> 32:05.319
Him sending people to kidnap my ex-wife...

457
32:05.319 --> 32:06.880
I really didn't expect that at all.

458
32:07.119 --> 32:08.000
At first, I thought

459
32:08.000 --> 32:09.400
he'd send someone to silence me.

460
32:10.160 --> 32:11.240
But then I thought about it,

461
32:12.359 --> 32:13.119
and it makes sense.

462
32:13.480 --> 32:14.240
If I died,

463
32:15.079 --> 32:16.319
you would keep investigating.

464
32:16.880 --> 32:17.839
But if I took all the blame

465
32:17.839 --> 32:19.000
on myself,

466
32:19.960 --> 32:22.079
maybe the police would close the case.

467
32:22.960 --> 32:23.960
Then he'd be safe.

468
32:24.480 --> 32:25.960
I think he never expected

469
32:26.400 --> 32:27.680
that you police would so quickly

470
32:27.680 --> 32:29.400
round up all the kidnappers.

471
32:32.160 --> 32:32.799
To be honest,

472
32:32.799 --> 32:33.920
if it weren't for that,

473
32:34.640 --> 32:35.640
I wouldn't have had the guts

474
32:35.640 --> 32:37.000
to confess and give up Chen Hai.

475
32:37.880 --> 32:39.480
Then between your escape

476
32:39.480 --> 32:41.119
and when we tracked you down,

477
32:41.359 --> 32:43.160
did you contact Chen Hai's people?

478
32:44.680 --> 32:45.200
No.

479
32:45.640 --> 32:47.279
Ever since the day the shipment was lost,

480
32:47.960 --> 32:48.960
I knew that I

481
32:48.960 --> 32:50.640
was in massive trouble.

482
32:50.839 --> 32:53.279
I haven't dealt much with Chen Hai,

483
32:53.519 --> 32:54.720
but I can tell

484
32:55.720 --> 32:58.759
there's a more powerful force behind him.

485
33:06.960 --> 33:08.119
I figured it out long ago.

486
33:08.799 --> 33:10.400
Whether I fall into Chen Hai's hands

487
33:11.839 --> 33:13.160
or end up with you cops,

488
33:15.359 --> 33:16.599
I'm a dead man either way.

489
33:16.920 --> 33:18.160
So you decided to run.

490
33:20.119 --> 33:21.000
If not for wanting

491
33:21.000 --> 33:22.480
to see my daughter one last time,

492
33:24.160 --> 33:26.200
I'd have left here long ago.

493
33:30.920 --> 33:32.720
I think you're being far too naive.

494
33:33.400 --> 33:34.240
You knew

495
33:34.359 --> 33:36.079
we'd definitely find you, right?

496
33:46.440 --> 33:47.519
There are things

497
33:47.680 --> 33:49.480
you might not fully understand yet.

498
33:52.440 --> 33:53.599
What you're about to deal with

499
33:56.119 --> 33:58.000
isn't an ordinary criminal organization,

500
33:58.599 --> 34:01.519
but a massive black hole filled with evil.

501
34:02.519 --> 34:03.759
Before upholding justice,

502
34:05.440 --> 34:07.200
you'd better protect yourselves first,

503
34:08.599 --> 34:10.519
so this black hole doesn't swallow you.

504
34:12.519 --> 34:13.320
Thank you for the warning.

505
34:14.000 --> 34:14.840
But I firmly believe

506
34:16.480 --> 34:18.039
justice will prevail over evil in the end.

507
34:34.840 --> 34:35.800
Tonight,

508
34:36.119 --> 34:39.039
move all this product for me.

509
34:39.480 --> 34:40.199
Understood?

510
34:56.639 --> 34:57.960
Boss, what's going on?

511
34:58.559 --> 35:00.199
Something happened to Yunfei in Jiangyang.

512
35:03.000 --> 35:04.000
What do we do now?

513
35:05.679 --> 35:06.119
Boss...

514
35:06.960 --> 35:08.039
Why don't we stay out of this?

515
35:08.400 --> 35:09.679
Mr. Ma isn't one of us anyway.

516
35:11.880 --> 35:14.079
After all, I did introduce Ma Jingrong to Theerade.

517
35:14.360 --> 35:15.199
Now that things have gone south,

518
35:16.920 --> 35:18.639
Jiang Liye definitely won't let us off.

519
35:19.159 --> 35:19.880
You can't go in!

520
35:27.800 --> 35:30.360
Mr. Theerade wants you tomorrow morning

521
35:30.719 --> 35:31.920
to go see Mr. Jiang.

522
35:32.039 --> 35:33.599
Did you really have to make such a fuss?

523
35:34.960 --> 35:36.519
Even if Mr. Jiang hadn't summoned me,

524
35:37.360 --> 35:39.039
I would still go see him.

525
35:40.800 --> 35:41.199
Fine.

526
35:43.000 --> 35:43.800
I believe you.

527
35:44.400 --> 35:46.199
Before 12:00 noon tomorrow.

528
35:47.639 --> 35:48.400
Don't be late.

529
35:53.159 --> 35:53.599
Let's go.

530
36:03.360 --> 36:05.039
Boss, what do we do now?

531
36:05.360 --> 36:07.039
Why don't we go lay low for a while?

532
36:08.320 --> 36:09.039
We can't hide.

533
36:10.440 --> 36:12.840
Hiding is a dead end.

534
36:50.559 --> 36:51.320
Mr. Jiang.

535
36:59.559 --> 37:00.679
Her husband's in prison,

536
37:02.159 --> 37:04.480
yet this woman seems quite at ease.

537
37:06.880 --> 37:08.880
Knowing they're about to die, some people

538
37:09.199 --> 37:10.360
they panic.

539
37:11.559 --> 37:14.800
Others seize their final moments

540
37:15.280 --> 37:16.280
to enjoy themselves.

541
37:19.559 --> 37:20.840
This woman is far from simple.

542
38:11.880 --> 38:12.400
Mr. Jiang.

543
38:14.360 --> 38:16.159
I've looked into President Ma's situation.

544
38:17.320 --> 38:19.400
Police are holding him in Hirano Prison.

545
38:20.679 --> 38:23.239
I'll find a way to get him out soon.

546
38:24.559 --> 38:25.760
Do you really have what it takes?

547
38:26.960 --> 38:28.119
The national treasure theft...

548
38:28.239 --> 38:30.400
isn't something money alone can fix.

549
38:31.119 --> 38:31.960
The national treasure theft

550
38:31.960 --> 38:33.840
had nothing to do with us anyway.

551
38:34.320 --> 38:36.639
Besides, the police have no evidence

552
38:36.639 --> 38:37.400
to charge President Ma.

553
38:37.400 --> 38:38.719
Whether Ma Jingrong lives or dies

554
38:38.719 --> 38:40.079
is none of my concern.

555
38:40.199 --> 38:41.239
What I care about is

556
38:41.880 --> 38:43.119
that my goods are gone.

557
38:43.679 --> 38:45.079
How do you plan to settle this?

558
38:49.800 --> 38:50.360
Mr. Jiang,

559
38:51.320 --> 38:52.280
we were just the middlemen

560
38:52.280 --> 38:53.280
who connected you two in business.

561
38:53.559 --> 38:55.559
You can't take all the profits

562
38:56.079 --> 38:57.280
and leave us to take the fall.

563
38:57.360 --> 38:57.920
Jin Qiang!

564
38:59.920 --> 39:01.239
Don't speak to Mr. Jiang like that!

565
39:09.480 --> 39:11.679
Young men act and speak rashly.

566
39:11.679 --> 39:12.440
It's understandable.

567
39:15.000 --> 39:15.800
Back in the day,

568
39:16.440 --> 39:17.559
when I was in Los Angeles,

569
39:18.440 --> 39:19.559
it was me against three guys.

570
39:21.440 --> 39:25.239
I grabbed a knife and charged right in.

571
39:26.000 --> 39:27.000
When the fight was over,

572
39:28.079 --> 39:28.800
guess how many of us

573
39:29.440 --> 39:32.639
ended up in the hospital?

574
39:34.320 --> 39:35.559
With how formidable you are, Mr. Jiang,

575
39:36.039 --> 39:38.519
you must have taken down all three.

576
39:38.599 --> 39:38.960
Wrong.

577
39:40.800 --> 39:42.320
Only one person went to the hospital.

578
39:43.800 --> 39:44.599
And that was me.

579
39:49.840 --> 39:50.679
Back then,

580
39:51.920 --> 39:53.559
just to show off some reckless bravado,

581
39:53.840 --> 39:56.880
I lay in a hospital bed for six months.

582
39:58.320 --> 40:00.400
Ever since, I realized

583
40:01.880 --> 40:03.880
that surviving in this world

584
40:06.360 --> 40:08.920
isn't about who's tougher than whom.

585
40:14.880 --> 40:18.800
It's about who reads the situation better.

586
40:21.800 --> 40:22.519
Mr. Jiang—

587
40:31.760 --> 40:33.119
"You're just middlemen

588
40:33.639 --> 40:34.840
who introduced a deal"?

589
40:35.800 --> 40:38.239
You chose to work with Ma Jingrong.

590
40:38.920 --> 40:40.480
Now you've lost my goods,

591
40:40.480 --> 40:41.400
so when I come looking for you,

592
40:42.280 --> 40:43.599
am I in the wrong?

593
40:44.960 --> 40:46.559
Mr. Jiang, regarding this matter,

594
40:48.239 --> 40:49.599
I will take full responsibility.

595
41:07.079 --> 41:09.159
Ma Jingrong's man was caught in Jiangyang.

596
41:09.159 --> 41:10.599
This is no simple matter.

597
41:12.000 --> 41:14.119
Is Ma Jingrong truly clean?

598
41:14.119 --> 41:15.480
I need an explanation.

599
41:15.760 --> 41:18.159
Mr. Theerade needs an explanation too.

600
41:19.119 --> 41:20.480
I'll give you two weeks.

601
41:22.199 --> 41:23.239
Don't worry, Mr. Jiang.

602
41:24.480 --> 41:27.400
I'll see this through to the end.

603
41:31.559 --> 41:32.000
All right.

604
41:35.599 --> 41:39.679
Care to stay for a casual bite?

605
41:42.920 --> 41:43.400
No, thank you.

606
41:44.760 --> 41:45.679
Thanks for the kind offer.

607
41:46.599 --> 41:47.960
What Mr. Jiang asked of us,

608
41:48.719 --> 41:50.400
we must resolve right away.

609
42:14.280 --> 42:15.199
What about this woman?

610
42:16.559 --> 42:17.199
Keep her for now.

611
42:18.559 --> 42:19.760
Maybe that guy Ma

612
42:20.599 --> 42:22.000
has what it takes to get out.

613
42:41.639 --> 42:42.119
Chinese?

614
42:43.199 --> 42:43.800
Chinese.

615
42:44.679 --> 42:45.599
What are you looking at?

616
42:45.840 --> 42:46.440
Pick it up.

617
42:47.280 --> 42:47.880
Pick it up!

618
42:49.159 --> 42:49.880
Clean it up.

619
43:31.320 --> 43:33.320
Eat up, Chinese.
